- `./week1_baseline/bin/python/04_api_client` runs against the same shared
  `.boukensha/` fixture directory, sends one real POST to the Anthropic API,
  and prints `Config:`/`Provider:`/`Model:`/`Sending request to ...` followed
  by a pretty-printed JSON response — matching `example.rb`'s output shape
